Z||000009||DecadenceR||06-06-2001||11:18 PM||||Well I dunno about your area, but around here most muffler shops will only do stock work. but sometimes you can find a place that'll let a mechanic do it for ya real quick for a few bucks. I'd just get out the yellow pages and start callin!||||reg||1
